\\inf \\{ L_g(\\gamma ):\\gamma :[0,1]\\to M\\text{ is }C^1,\\  \\gamma (0)=p,\\  \\gamma (1)=q\\} \\in [0,\\infty ],  \\]\">\\[  d_g(p,q)=\\inf \\{ L_g(\\gamma ):\\gamma :[0,1]\\to M\\text{ is }C^1,\\  \\gamma (0)=p,\\  \\gamma (1)=q\\} \\in [0,\\infty ],  \\]</span> where the infimum of the empty set is <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$\\infty $\">$\\infty $</span>. ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:connected-manifold-admissible-curve","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#rem:riemannian-distance-c1-vs-admissible","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:riemannian-metric","title":"def:riemannian-metric","label":"def:riemannian-metric"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:length-of-curve","title":"def:length-of-curve","label":"def:length-of-curve"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:connected-manifold-admissible-curve","title":"prop:connected-manifold-admissible-curve","label":"prop:connected-manifold-admissible-curve"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#rem:riemannian-distance-c1-vs-admissible","title":"rem:riemannian-distance-c1-vs-admissible","label":"rem:riemannian-distance-c1-vs-admissible"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:connected-manifold-c1-curve","title":"prop:connected-manifold-c1-curve","label":"prop:connected-manifold-c1-curve"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-symm","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-symm","label":"lem:riemannian-distance-symm"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:riemannian-distance-triangle","title":"lem:riemannian-distance-triangle","label":"lem:riemannian-distanc